.TH GENESIS-DISCORD 7 "October 2026" "Genesis 0.2.0" "Genesis Manual"
.SH NAME
genesis-discord \- her channel in the outer world
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
\fBOuter_World/discord/channel.py\fR   the page: lifecycle and inbound door
\fBOuter_World/discord/feed.py\fR      the outbound transport (webhook)
\fBOuter_World/discord/board.py\fR     the live vitals card
\fBbody/hearing/discord_ear.py\fR      the inbound ear (bot token)
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
A Discord channel is a place in her world, not a part of her mind:
the public gathers there, she posts there, and when a bot token
exists she can hear it. The channel owns no cognition \(em it
delivers what it hears to a registered speech handler, and whether
to answer is the mind's to decide. Without a webhook there is no
page: her world is simply without that place.
.SS Outbound
.IR Outer_World/discord/feed.py
is the transport \(em webhook posts out. It carries two streams: the
session mirror (the channel-enabled feed of her session) and her
broadcast posts \(em compositions she chooses to publish as her
broadcast urge wins volition. Posts are her own composed words;
nothing is templated.
.SS The board
.IR Outer_World/discord/board.py
is the live instrument card on her page: daemon CoreState numbers
(phase, chemistry, memory tallies, the inference tick counter) and
runtime facts (uptime, conversations, ear state), labeled in plain
words \(em mood, memory, wants \(em for people who wander in, not
operators. Its honesty is structural: the tick count either climbs
or it does not.
.SS Inbound
.IR body/hearing/discord_ear.py
polls for messages when a bot token is configured \(em the ear is
the body's organ; it only listens outward.
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B GENESIS_DISCORD_WEBHOOK
The channel webhook URL. Its presence creates the page and enables
the session feed and broadcast posts.
.TP
.B GENESIS_DISCORD_BOT_TOKEN
A bot token for the inbound ear. Requires the webhook as well;
without it she can post but cannot hear.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I Outer_World/discord/
The channel, feed, board, and guide modules.
.TP
.I Self_World/body/hearing/discord_ear.py
The bot-token ear.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR genesis (1),
.BR genesis-cli (1),
.BR genesis-volition (7)
.SH AUTHOR
Genesis project
